maaqqoda» yeegeenee?","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Ma Xoossii fa bayra Na7a yha alame kiittittar,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"«Xoossii kiitanchchitay ubbay ees goynno»","poem":1},"yeegeeza."]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["Xoossii kiitanchchitay bagga odittar,",{"text":"«Xoossii fa Kiitanchchita carkkita,","poem":1},{"text":"fa ayllita tama lath udiza»","poem":2},"yeegiza."]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["Zini fa Na7ay bagga odittar,",{"text":"«Xoosso, ne kaatetithay medhinas yeziza.","poem":1},{"text":"Ne kaatetitha ne xillotithar aqisoda.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"Neenii xillotithi doseeza; iitatith ixxeeza.","poem":1},{"text":"Xoossay, ne Goday, nena ne zhamitaypp aathii dooreeza,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ufayss zayite","poem":2},{"noteId":0},{"text":"nena tizheeza»","poem":2},"yeegiza."]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["Xoossii mahii,",{"text":"«Godayyo, tiina neenii sa7a medhdheeza;","poem":1},{"text":"salitay ne kushe oosita.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"Yeyititay ubbay dhaboda;","poem":1},{"text":"zin neenii yezoda.","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Unttii ubbay afila garkk wuroda.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"Neenii unttan saline garkk xaaxoda;","poem":1},{"text":"ma unttii afila garkk laaminttoda.","poem":2},{"text":"Zini neenii ubba wode nena;","poem":1},{"text":"ne laythitayiskka wuristhii baaya»","poem":2},"yeegiza."]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["Zini Xooss kiitanchchitaypp ooko,",{"text":"«Taanii ne morkkita ne tokay","poem":1},{"text":"yedhdhiz aqo udod hellodayis,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"yhaydda taapp ushachch baggar bettoba» yeegeenee?","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["Kiitanchchitay ubbay atotith denggodayis yez asita maaddodayis Xoossii kiitteez ayyanita baasannee?"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"Ufayss zayite: E kawutiza wode asay ufayisar ililii eza kawutisiza beeziza.","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/mfx_ltw/HEB/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/mfx_ltw/HEB/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/mfx_ltw/PHM/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}